{"sections":[{"slug":"量子几何Langlands纲领","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"量子几何Langlands纲领"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">量子几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">纲领</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"量子几何 Langlands 纲领"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">量子几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">纲领认为复曲线上</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">丛模空间上的扭曲</span> D-<span lang=\"zh\">模的导出范畴和和</span> $G^L$-<span lang=\"zh\">丛模空间的相应范畴之间存在一个等价</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}